{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "备考导航", "images": []}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "第01讲　备考导航", "images": []}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "中药学综合知识与技能", "images": []}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "备考导航 \n　　目 录 \n　　一、科目概论与学科介绍 \n　　二、考情分析与学习方法 \n　　三、复习规划与备考策略 \n\n　　一、科目概论与学科介绍 \n　　《中药学综合知识与技能》主要考查中药学类考生综合运用所学的各项知识和技能，正确分析、处理和解决在开展药品质量管理和指导合理用药工作中所遇到各种实际问题的能力，集中反映执业药师理论联系实际、有效开展药学服务的综合知识与技能的要求。 \n　　—国家执业药师考试大纲（第八版·2024） \n　　《中药学综合知识与技能》考试指南变动分析", "images": []}, {"type": "table", "rows": [[{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "内容", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "2024年", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "2025年", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "变幅", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "变动", "images": []}]}], [{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "页数", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "408页", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "451页", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "43页", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "增加", "images": []}]}], [{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "章", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "13章", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "13章", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "/", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "合并调整", "images": []}]}], [{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "节", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "94节", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "96节", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "2节", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "合并重组\n有增有减", "images": []}]}], [{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "字数", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "720千字", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "807千字", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "87千字", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "增加", "images": []}]}], [{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "总结", "images": []}]}, {"span": 4, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "核心章节保持不变，新增新改考点值得关注", "images": []}]}]]}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "《中药学综合知识与技能》考试指南目录 \n　　第一章　执业药师与中药药学服务 \n　　第二章　中医理论基础 \n　　第三章　中医诊断基础 \n　　第四章　常用医学检查指标及其临床意义 \n　　第五章　中医内科常见病的辨证论治 \n　　第六章　中医外科常见病的辨证论治 \n　　第七章　中医妇科常见病的辨证论治 \n　　第八章　中医儿科及五官科常见病的辨证论治 \n　　第九章　民族医药基础知识 \n　　第十章　中药质量管理 \n　　第十一章　中药调剂 \n　　第十二章　中药的合理应用和健康促进 \n　　第十三章　中药用药安全", "images": []}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "", "images": ["/textbooks/f980bcf905ee0e306be5.png"]}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "二、考情分析与学习方法 \n　　《中药学综合知识与技能》——中医模块 \n　　中医理论基础 \n　　中医诊断基础 \n　　常用医学检查指标及其临床意义 \n　　中医内科常见病的辨证论治 \n　　中医外科常见病的辨证论治 \n　　中医妇科常见病的辨证论治 \n　　中医儿科及五官科常见病的辨证论治 \n　　中医模块　近三年各章分值", "images": []}, {"type": "table", "rows": [[{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "章节", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "2022年", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "2023年", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "2024年", "images": []}]}], [{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "☆中基", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "17分", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "18分", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "16分", "images": []}]}], [{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "☆中诊", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragra