ph", "text": "76分", "images": []}]}]]}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "注：历年分值已根据新大纲进行了相应的调整 \n　　《中药学综合知识与技能》——中药模块 \n　　执业药师与中药药学服务 \n　　民族医药基础知识 \n　　中药质量管理 \n　　中药调剂 \n　　中药的合理应用和健康促进 \n　　中药用药安全 \n　　中药模块　近三年各章分值", "images": []}, {"type": "table", "rows": [[{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "章节", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "2022年", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "2023年", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "2024年", "images": []}]}], [{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "中药药学服务", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "2分", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "2分", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "2分", "images": []}]}], [{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "民族医药", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "1分", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "1分", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "1分", "images": []}]}], [{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "☆中药质量管理", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "13分", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "15分", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "15分", "images": []}]}], [{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "中药调剂", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": []}, {"span": 1, "blocks": []}, {"span": 1, "blocks": []}], [{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "☆合理应用", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "15分", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "17分", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "16分", "images": []}]}], [{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "用药安全", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "8分", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "10分", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "10分", "images": []}]}], [{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "总计", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "39分", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "45分", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "44分", "images": []}]}]]}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "注：历年分值已根据新大纲进行了相应的调整 \n　　中医模块　近三年分值 \n　　2022年：81分 \n　　2023年：75分 \n　　2024年：76分 \n　　中药模块　近三年分值 \n　　2022年：39分 \n　　2023年：45分 \n　　2024年：44分", "images": []}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "", "images": ["/textbooks/4b1bd5c175666103fc3e.png"]}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "三、复习规划与备考策略", "images": []}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "", "images": ["/textbooks/7c12e62e9b5dc77a70ca.png"]}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "应试如对弈，知己知彼百战不殆！ \n　　1.中医模块： \n　　◆学习顺序：中基→中诊→常见病的辨证论治→医学检查 \n　　◆学习要点：强调逻辑推演和临床思维 \n　　◆学习方法：先理解，后记忆；做笔记，重练习 \n　　◆柏轩老师说：中医是活的逻辑，不是死的条文！", "images": []}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "", "images": ["/textbooks/8c95dea2db8076a3384d.png"]}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "2.中药模块： \n　　◆关联实际工作（如：第十一章　中药调剂） \n　　◆结合中药一中的中药化学、中药炮制学等相关知识 \n　　◆记忆技巧+习题练习（记忆不是能力，而是方法） \n　　◆可“舍”的部分（医学检查、民族医药基础知识）", "images": []}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "", "images": ["/textbooks/8ade88233a145d0529af.png"]}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "3.备考“加油站”： \n　　◆图书选择：考试指南、习题册、速记类、试卷类 ....... \n　　=医学教育网讲义（与课程同步、干货多、实用性强） \n　　◆四科复习顺序：中药综→中药二→中药一→法规 \n　　◆记忆困惑：记忆不要谈遍数，因为标准是记住！ \n　　◆考试形式：机考（2025年10月18日，下午14:30～17:00）", "images": []}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "", "images": ["/textbooks/8490154dc99ff5cfb96d.png"]}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "= 我的方法+你的坚持", "images": []}]}